[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0010","text":"——制作人，说是堵车了……\n还得再等一会儿呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0020","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0030","text":"啊，对了路加酱！\n现在这条线路有联动电车在跑哦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0040","text":"名字一下子想不起来，\n是个企鹅角色……蓝色的电车！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0050","text":"在这里等着的话说不定会来……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0060","text":"路加酱……要去哪？\n不看联动电车吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0070","text":"不知道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0080","text":"但是，制作人可能会来啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0090","text":"那种东西谁要等啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800300_02_0100","text":"等、等一下……！\n路加酱……！"}]
